PRO GEO2CART,LAT,LON,X,Y,Z
;*************************************************************************
;CONVERTS GEOGRAPHIC LATITUDES AND LONGITUDES TO X,Y,Z CARTESIAN COORDS.
;X AXIS IS ALONG 0LAT, 0LON DIRECTION
;Y AXIS IS ALONG 0LAT, 90LON DIRECTION
;Z AXIS IS ALONG 90 LAT DIRECTION
;ANGLES MUST BE IN RADIANS! USE DEG2RAD FUNCTION TO CONVERT.


X=COS(LON) * COS(LAT)
Y=SIN(LON) * COS(LAT)
Z=SIN(LAT)

END




end
